'''Happy New Year?''' (新年、あけました！おめっ…, ''Shinnen, Akemashita! Ome...'', '''New Year, has Arrived! Congra...''') is the January event in [[The Battle Cats]]. It was added in [[Version 2.1 Update#Version 2.1.1 Update|Version 2.1.1]].

==Event Information==
During this event, access the {{Color|#FF0000|'''"Happy New Year!"'''}} stages by visiting the "Stories of Legend" game mode!<br>
New and unknown enemies await you! There might even be something interesting at the end of the quest!<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''This event starts the 1st of January (12:00am) and continues until the 1st of February (10:59am)'''}}

Get a chance to unlock {{Color|#0000FF|'''Adult Cat'''}} upon clearing any event stage! Your chances will increase greatly if you play later, more difficult stages! (Or get a {{Color|#FF0000|100%}} chance to collect rewards by using the {{Color|#FF0000|Treasure Radar item}}!)

※ After you have picked up Adult Cat, unlock it at the Rare Cats section of the Upgrade menu. If you have collected Reindeer Fish Cat from a previous event, it cannot be collected again.

